# --- Vendor assets: analysed locally, never redistributed -------------------
# Everything below is eowave's copyrighted material — firmware images, the
# official manual, and the scraped original editor. Analysing them locally for
# interoperability is lawful; republishing them from this public repo is not.
# They stay on disk and work normally; git simply never records them.
# Do not remove these rules.
research/firmware/
# legacy top-level dumps from early analysis (superseded by research/firmware/)
research/firmware-*
research/original-editor/
research/*.pdf
research/*.uf2
research/*.bin
research/portail-manual.*
research/portail_manual_v1.*
research/eowave-portail-page.html
research/modwiggler-raw.html

# --- Private security findings: coordinated disclosure, never publish -------
research/security-findings.md

# Safety net: never publish security/disclosure notes added under research/ later
research/*security*
research/*disclosure*
research/*findings*

